		(property "Description" "40-position 0.5mm-pitch bottom-contact ZIF FPC connector for the Crystalfontz CFAF240320A0-024SN display, 4-wire SPI pinout (pilink-7el.5). Pin table sourced directly from Crystalfontz's own datasheet (Rev 1v2, 2021-03-26), section 6, SPI-mode column. LCSC candidate connector part AFC01-S40FCA-00 (LCSC C262674, Jushuo), confirmed 0.5mm pitch / 40-position / bottom-contact / flip-top-lock from its own LCSC spec table -- matches the panel's own 40 Position, 0.50mm Pitch ZIF connector spec. No stock KiCad symbol exists for this exact part; hand-authored here, pin layout is a simple single-column schematic convenience (not a physical pinout diagram) -- see this project's Footprint caveat for the matching hand-authored footprint's own verification gap."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(effects
